                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (2n,n)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism"} cobordism
            classes, at least over fields of characteristic zero.
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
